# Intentionally contains no variables.
#
# test/unit-cptool-tooling.mjs points DOTENV_PATH here when it spawns the bin/
# scripts, so those child processes cannot read the developer's real .env.
# Without it the suite is not hermetic: a local CREDENTIALS_KEY sends the
# re-key tests down a refusal path instead of the happy path, and local
# *_EXECUTOR_ENABLED flags change which channels bin/tick.mjs reports.
